12
00:00:40,036 --> 00:00:45,200
Paused research doesn't prevent that check while the
page and public node remain reachable.

13
00:00:48,400 --> 00:00:52,104
Claude Code can use the same
research tools over MCP.

14
00:00:52,104 --> 00:00:57,503
The spending caps come from the environment;
the calling model can't raise them.

15
00:00:57,503 --> 00:01:02,400
This result cites our own labelled notes
and links its Testnet payments.

16
00:01:06,400 --> 00:01:09,575
Export the receipts and check them outside the app.

17
00:01:09,575 --> 00:01:13,251
Our TypeScript and Python verifiers
were written separately.

18
00:01:13,251 --> 00:01:18,765
Read the passed and skipped checks; a receipt
verification result does not certify a writer's

19
00:01:18,765 --> 00:01:19,600
