20
00:01:20,700 --> 00:01:24,264
Three operator-run writers now hold
accepted Testnet Credentials.

21
00:01:24,264 --> 00:01:29,034
A Permissioned Domain lists the credential issuer
and type accepted for identity display.

22
00:01:29,034 --> 00:01:33,100
It's our attestation: not KYC, quality
certification or payment permission.

23
00:01:34,200 --> 00:01:36,123
We ask rippled before signing.

24
00:01:36,123 --> 00:01:41,144
In recorded unsigned probes, RLUSD escrow returned
