25
00:01:41,144 --> 00:01:44,135
The matched TEST-SGD control succeeded on Testnet.

26
00:01:44,135 --> 00:01:45,630
Nothing was submitted.

27
00:01:45,630 --> 00:01:50,491
Our browser sandbox pays in Testnet XRP;
TEST-SGD is a labelled stand-in, and mainnet

28
